+# CONTRACT — SSG Toolkit Plugins (T9)
+
+Each plugin exports `createXxxPlugin(): Plugin`. `version: '1.0.0'`. Verify with `npm test`, `npm run build`, `npm run lint`.
+
+## Wave 1
+
+### markdown-ext (deps: [])
+- [ ] basic markdown → HTML (`<h1>`, `<strong>bold</strong>`) → markdown-ext.test
+- [ ] inline footnote ref `[^1]` → `<sup><a href="#fn-1">1</a></sup>`
+- [ ] footnote defs `[^1]: text` → `<section class="footnotes">` with `<li id="fn-1">text</li>`
+- [ ] `:::note|warning|tip` → `<div class="admonition admonition-TYPE">…content…</div>`
+- [ ] preserves existing HTML; handles empty content
+
+### asset-pipeline (deps: [])
+- [ ] rewrite relative `src`/`href` (`./x.png`) → `/assets/x.png`; leave absolute (`http(s)://`) unchanged
+- [ ] do not double-process `/assets/...` (content unchanged, no manifest entry)
+- [ ] manifest `ctx.data['asset-manifest'] = { assets: string[] }`, accumulates across calls, basename entries
+- [ ] no-asset content returned byte-identical
+
+### syntax-highlight (deps: [])
+- [ ] `<pre><code class="language-X">` → code class `language-X highlighted` + `<pre data-language="X">`
+- [ ] no-language code block & inline `<code>` untouched (byte-identical, no "highlighted")
+- [ ] multiple blocks; empty code block still tagged
+
+### taxonomy (deps: [])
+- [ ] beforeBuild builds `ctx.data['taxonomy-tags']: Map<string, ContentFile[]>`, tags lowercased, no-tag files excluded
+- [ ] afterBuild writes `tags/<tag>.html` listing all file titles for that tag
+- [ ] empty file list → map size 0, no pages
+
+## Wave 2
+
+### rss-feed (deps: markdown-ext, taxonomy)
+- [ ] afterBuild → `feed.xml`: RSS2.0 (`<?xml`, `<rss version="2.0">`, `<channel>`, `<item>`, `</rss>`)
+- [ ] item description `<![CDATA[<html>]]>`; channel `<title>{config.title}</title>`
+- [ ] `<category>tag</category>` from tags; items sorted by date desc; no `<pubDate>undefined</pubDate>`
+- [ ] channel `<link>{baseUrl}</link>`, item `<link>{baseUrl}/{slug}.html</link>`
+
+### search-index (deps: markdown-ext, syntax-highlight)
+- [ ] afterBuild → `search-index.json` JSON array of `{title, slug, content(plain text), tags?}`
+- [ ] HTML stripped (no `<`/`>`); code text preserved; empty list → `[]`; tags included if present
+
+## Wave 3
+
+### sitemap (deps: taxonomy, rss-feed)
+- [ ] afterBuild → `sitemap.xml`: valid urlset; one `<loc>{baseUrl}/{key}</loc>` per output entry (content, tag pages, feed.xml); no `/tags/` when none
+
+### dev-server (deps: asset-pipeline, search-index)
+- [ ] afterBuild → `ctx.data['dev-server-config'] = {port:3000, routes, assetPaths, searchIndexPath}`
+- [ ] assetPaths from asset-manifest (`[]` if missing); asset routes (handler:'asset') per asset
+- [ ] static routes (handler:'static') per `.html` output; searchIndexPath `/search-index.json` when present
